cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the SAR-YOLO architecture in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "SAR-YOLO: Speckle-Aware Feature Representation for Robust SAR Object Detection"
abstract: >-
  SAR-YOLO is a synthetic aperture radar (SAR) object detection architecture that
  augments a YOLO baseline with evidence-driven, SAR-specific modules: a SAR
  Feature Enhancement (SFE) block, a Speckle-Aware Feature Module (SFM), a
  SAR-Adaptive Attention (SAA) block, Adaptive Multi-Scale Fusion (AMF), and a
  high-resolution small-object detection head. The repository contains the full
  reproducible pipeline from dataset validation through ablation, robustness,
  efficiency, and cross-dataset generalization studies.
type: software
license: MIT
